# OPTIONAL John external-token test. No Elsa password/login is needed for John.
# Run pwsh -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ./New-TestAccessToken.ps1 -Provider Username -Identity john
# Restart the app if the signing key is newly created. Paste the token, not its JSON payload.
@johnToken = PASTE_GENERATED_TOKEN

### John lists assigned tasks
# Use External-Masters.http for GET member selection and an approval assigned to John. Copy participantId from the master, not the token sub or display name. No external registration POST/database is involved.
# @name johnTasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/elsa/api/user-tasks?scope=assigned&status=Assigned
Authorization: Bearer {{johnToken}}

